88-0184","ن ع م","B001","root_001525","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0185","ن ع م","B002","root_001525","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0186","ن ع م","B003","root_001525","B003","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0187","ن ع م","B005","root_001525","B005","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0188","ن ع م","B011","root_001525","B011","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0189","ن و ر","B002","root_001564","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0190","و ج ه","B001","root_001630","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0191","و ج ه","B002","root_001630","B002","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0192","و ج ه","B003","root_001630","B003","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0193","و ج ه","B006","root_001630","B006","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0194","و ض ع","B001","root_001657","B001","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0195","و ض ع","B005","root_001657","B005","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0196","و ض ع","B010","root_001657","B010","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0197","و ض ع","B013","root_001657","B013","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0198","و ل ي","B004","root_001684","B004","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0199","و ل ي","B006","root_001684","B006","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0200","و ل ي","B007","root_001684","B007","resolved_source_exact"],["a-s088-0201","و ل ي","B012","root_001684","B012","resolved_source_exact"]],"review_columns":["anchor_key","source_path","line","ayah_ref","raw_excerpt"],"review_rows":[["a-s088-0007","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",145,"88:10","1. **Covered garden raised above the low faces.** Evidence: `ج نن` B003 tree-covered garden, B001 concealment/covering; `ع ل و` B001 rising/high; earlier `خ ش ع` B002 low ground. Structural cue: the garden follows satisfied endeavor and contrasts with humbled low faces. Role: garden supplies protective/enclosed cover; highness supplies vertical reversal. Abductive move: not every covering is punitive; the same broad cover-imagery can be sheltering when joined to favor. Reading change: the garden reads as elevated protective enclosure, not merely a location."],["a-s088-0001","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",145,"88:10","1. **Covered garden raised above the low faces.** Evidence: `ج نن` B003 tree-covered garden, B001 concealment/covering; `ع ل و` B001 rising/high; earlier `خ ش ع` B002 low ground. Structural cue: the garden follows satisfied endeavor and contrasts with humbled low faces. Role: garden supplies protective/enclosed cover; highness supplies vertical reversal. Abductive move: not every covering is punitive; the same broad cover-imagery can be sheltering when joined to favor. Reading change: the garden reads as elevated protective enclosure, not merely a location."],["a-s088-0012","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",147,"88:10","2. **Hidden interior against the public face.** Evidence: `ج نن` B010 hidden heart/inner matter; `و ج ه` B001 outward face in 88:8; `ر ض و` B001 inward acceptance. Structural cue: face, satisfaction, and garden appear in sequence. Role: the garden externalizes an inward state of hidden contentment. Abductive move: final place can manifest the inner matter that the face displays. Reading change: `جنة` carries interiority, not only botanical cover."],["a-s088-0006","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",237,"88:16","The later `الأرض كيف سطحت` made this furnishing unexpectedly cosmological: spread carpets and spread earth echo one another. `بث` B002 also made the garden an answer to concealed grief, especially after the painful first half."],["a-s088-0002","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",315,"88:22","2. **No written-line domination over persons.** Evidence: `س طر` B001 aligned written row/recording, B003 control; `ذ ك ر` B008 legal instrument; later `ح س ب` B001 account. Structural cue: reminder/record/account language surrounds the control negation. Role: `مسيطر` could imply supervisory record-control, but it is denied here. Abductive move: the final record belongs elsewhere; the reminder does not own the ledger. Reading change: the ayah separates notification from accounting authority."],["a-s088-0008","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",315,"88:22","2. **No written-line domination over persons.** Evidence: `س طر` B001 aligned written row/recording, B003 control; `ذ ك ر` B008 legal instrument; later `ح س ب` B001 account. Structural cue: reminder/record/account language surrounds the control negation. Role: `مسيطر` could imply supervisory record-control, but it is denied here. Abductive move: the final record belongs elsewhere; the reminder does not own the ledger. Reading change: the ayah separates notification from accounting authority."],["a-s088-0004","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",317,"88:22","3. **Contrast with ordered rows and spread surfaces.** Evidence: `س طر` B001 rows; earlier `ص فف` B001 rows of cushions, `س طح` B001 flat surface. Structural cue: the surah has many ordered spatial lines, but this line rejects a human controller over people. Role: order is real, but not imposed by the reminder as domination. Abductive move: created/garden order and coercive human control must be distinguished. Reading change: the ayah becomes a theological limit on order-making."],["a-s088-0005","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",317,"88:22","3. **Contrast with ordered rows and spread surfaces.** Evidence: `س طر` B001 rows; earlier `ص فف` B001 rows of cushions, `س طح` B001 flat surface. Structural cue: the surah has many ordered spatial lines, but this line rejects a human controller over people. Role: order is real, but not imposed by the reminder as domination. Abductive move: created/garden order and coercive human control must be distinguished. Reading change: the ayah becomes a theological limit on order-making."],["a-s088-0003","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",317,"88:22","3. **Contrast with ordered rows and spread surfaces.** Evidence: `س طر` B001 rows; earlier `ص فف` B001 rows of cushions, `س طح` B001 flat surface. Structural cue: the surah has many ordered spatial lines, but this line rejects a human controller over people. Role: order is real, but not imposed by the reminder as domination. Abductive move: created/garden order and coercive human control must be distinguished. Reading change: the ayah becomes a theological limit on order-making."],["a-s088-0010","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",335,"88:23","The repeated face/look orientation made `تولى` much more embodied: a face that should look turns away. The provision chain made `كفر` B004 especially active alongside B003."],["a-s088-0009","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",335,"88:23","The repeated face/look orientation made `تولى` much more embodied: a face that should look turns away. The provision chain made `كفر` B004 especially active alongside B003."],["a-s088-0011","v12/runs/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",347,"88:24","4. **Womb/afterbirth echo under divine return.** Evidence: `ع ذب` B009 womb/afterbirth; opening `ر ح م` B003 womb; final `ء و ب` B001 return. Structural cue: divine punishment comes just before return/account. Role: this branch faintly links pain, emergence, and return to origin imagery. Abductive move: final accounting can reactivate birth/afterbirth vocabulary as a hard passage rather than comfort. Reading change: exploratory: punishment may carry a painful expulsion/afterbirth undertone beside juridical torment."],["a-s088-0013","v12/runs_11ayah/s088/full_context_control/reader_s088_a_ayah_walk.md",329,"88:19","88:20 clarified mountain solidity as a productive interruption within an extended earth. 88:21-24 then constrained the social B012 \"chiefs like mountains\" activation: the reminder receives no controlling mass, and punitive jurisdiction is explicitly assigned to God."]]}
